{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-7","type":"group","x":0,"y":5720,"width":2380,"height":1540,"label":"Devotee"},
		{"id":"g-9","type":"group","x":0,"y":7340,"width":2380,"height":1320,"label":"Thief"},
		{"id":"g-5","type":"group","x":0,"y":2520,"width":2380,"height":1300,"label":"Duelist"},
		{"id":"g-8","type":"group","x":0,"y":4600,"width":2380,"height":1020,"label":"Tinkerer"},
		{"id":"g-2","type":"group","x":0,"y":-120,"width":2380,"height":1000,"label":"Soldier"},
		{"id":"g-4","type":"group","x":0,"y":1580,"width":2380,"height":860,"label":"Bardic"},
		{"id":"g-1","type":"group","x":0,"y":-1000,"width":2380,"height":760,"label":"Tank"},
		{"id":"g-24","type":"group","x":0,"y":17120,"width":2380,"height":760,"label":"Alignment"},
		{"id":"g-0","type":"group","x":0,"y":-1840,"width":2380,"height":740,"label":"Squire"},
		{"id":"g-17","type":"group","x":0,"y":12880,"width":2380,"height":720,"label":"Axe"},
		{"id":"g-23","type":"group","x":0,"y":16320,"width":2380,"height":720,"label":"Origin"},
		{"id":"g-12","type":"group","x":0,"y":9960,"width":2380,"height":680,"label":"Unarmed"},
		{"id":"g-19","type":"group","x":0,"y":14080,"width":2380,"height":660,"label":"Dagger"},
		{"id":"g-10","type":"group","x":0,"y":8800,"width":2380,"height":620,"label":"Thaumaturgy"},
		{"id":"g-6","type":"group","x":0,"y":3920,"width":2380,"height":580,"label":"Acrobat"},
		{"id":"g-3","type":"group","x":0,"y":940,"width":2380,"height":560,"label":"Courier"},
		{"id":"g-15","type":"group","x":0,"y":11840,"width":2380,"height":540,"label":"Mass"},
		{"id":"g-14","type":"group","x":0,"y":11200,"width":2380,"height":535,"label":"Spear"},
		{"id":"g-21","type":"group","x":0,"y":15340,"width":2380,"height":500,"label":"Bow"},
		{"id":"g-11","type":"group","x":0,"y":9480,"width":2380,"height":400,"label":"Theurgy"},
		{"id":"g-20","type":"group","x":0,"y":14840,"width":2380,"height":400,"label":"Flail"},
		{"id":"g-13","type":"group","x":0,"y":10740,"width":2380,"height":340,"label":"Sword"},
		{"id":"g-22","type":"group","x":0,"y":15920,"width":2380,"height":320,"label":"Crossbow"},
		{"id":"g-16","type":"group","x":0,"y":12480,"width":2380,"height":290,"label":"Shield"},
		{"id":"g-18","type":"group","x":0,"y":13690,"width":2380,"height":280,"label":"Hook"},
		{"id":"n-12-9","type":"text","text":"**[Burr]** \nWhen you are grappling a target, you instead move whenever they move, including forced movement.","x":500,"y":10500,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-13-1","type":"text","text":"**[Cleave]** \nIf you would reduce a target to 0 HP with a Sword, you can choose to deal the excess damage to another target adjacent to you without rolling to hit.","x":500,"y":10760,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-13-3","type":"text","text":"**[Steel Lotus]** \nWhile wielding a Sword, you Threaten all spaces within your reach, even if you aren't Facing them.","x":500,"y":10940,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-14-0","type":"text","text":"**[Thrusting Strike]** \nWhen attacking with a Spear weapon, you can spend additional (#) AP to increase your Range by (#) for the rest of your turn.","x":20,"y":11240,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-14-1","type":"text","text":"**[Set Spear]** \nWhile wielding a Spear, you can perform an attack against a target when entering spaces you Threaten.","x":1000,"y":11240,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-14-2","type":"text","text":"**[Impale]** \nWhen attacking with a Spear, Defenders cannot benefit from Partially Covered.","x":20,"y":11400,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-14-3","type":"text","text":"**[Crucify]** \nIf you would reduce a target to 0 HP with a Spear, you can choose to deal the excess damage to another target within range without rolling to hit.","x":500,"y":11400,"width":410,"height":142},
		{"id":"n-14-4","type":"text","text":"**[Javelin Toss I]** \nWhen throwing a Spear weapon you can move 2 Paces towards the target as part of the attack.","x":20,"y":11580,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-14-5","type":"text","text":"**[Javelin Toss II]** \nWhen throwing a Spear weapon you can move 2 additional Paces towards the target as part of the attack, for a total of 4 Paces.","x":1000,"y":11580,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-11-7","type":"text","text":"**[Vessel]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to flood your body with your Entity's energy. This effect lasts as long as you choose to maintain it; for the duration you roll all spells with Advantage (1) and gain 1 Fatigue at the end of each of your turns. After gaining the Fatigue, you may choose to expel the energy.","x":1000,"y":9621,"width":410,"height":239},
		{"id":"n-12-0","type":"text","text":"**[Throat Punch - Maneuver]** \nYou punch the throat, dealing no damage; the target's word limit is reduced to 5 until the end of their next turn.","x":20,"y":9980,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-3","type":"text","text":"**[Martial Arts]** \nYour Unarmed weapons are treated as a Light Unarmed weapon that uses Strength or Dexterity and targets Strength or Dexterity. This grants the increase to max AP provided by Light Weapons.","x":20,"y":10160,"width":410,"height":171},
		{"id":"n-12-4","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Fist]** \nYour Unarmed weapons are treated as Versatile instead of Light, which have a base damage die of 1d8 which increases to 1d10 if both hands are empty.","x":500,"y":10160,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-12-8","type":"text","text":"**[Crushing Grip]** \nAt the start of your turn, you deal untyped damage to a target you are grappling equal to your Strength score.","x":1000,"y":10500,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-13-0","type":"text","text":"**[First Blood]** \nThe first Wound you would leave with a Sword in an encounter is always Moderate.","x":20,"y":10760,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-13-2","type":"text","text":"**[Compact Form]** \nWhile wielding a Sword, you are immune to the Cramped Condition.","x":20,"y":10940,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-13-4","type":"text","text":"**[Hurricane]** \nYou can expend 3 AP to make an attack against every target within range of your Sword.","x":1000,"y":10940,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-12-2","type":"text","text":"**[The Art of Nine Limbs]** \nIf you expend 3+ AP on performing attacks with an Unarmed weapon, you can make another attack with an Unarmed weapon without expending AP.","x":1460,"y":9980,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-12-1","type":"text","text":"**[Pressure Point - Maneuver]** \nYou hit a specific point, dealing no damage; the target suffers the Unsteady (1) Condition.","x":1000,"y":9980,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-5","type":"text","text":"**[Steel Fist]**\nYour Unarmed weapons are treated as Heavy instead of Versatile, which deals 1d12 damage and requires both hands to be empty.","x":1000,"y":10160,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-12-6","type":"text","text":"**[Vanishing Fist]** \nYou can still Evade while using your Heavy Unarmed weapons, and have Advantage (1) on all Maneuver contests performed with them.","x":1460,"y":10160,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-11-1","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations II]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (2).","x":500,"y":9500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-6","type":"text","text":"**[Miracle]** \nOnce per encounter, when you would be reduced to 0 HP, you can choose to remain at 1 HP instead.","x":500,"y":9617,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-11-2","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations III]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (3).","x":1000,"y":9500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-12-7","type":"text","text":"**[Kick]** \nYou do not need a free hand to perform attacks with an Unarmed weapon, and your Unarmed weapons have Reach.","x":500,"y":10340,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-11-0","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations I]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (1).","x":20,"y":9500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-5","type":"text","text":"**[Censure - Maneuver]** \nYou entreat your Entity to censure a target within Earshot, making a Willpower vs. Willpower Contest; on a failure, the word count of the target's spells are doubled until the end of their turn.","x":20,"y":9620,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-10-8","type":"text","text":"**[Spell Exemption II]** \nWhen you Cast a spell with an AOE, you can choose to ignore 3 targets.","x":500,"y":9120,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-9","type":"text","text":"**[Spell Exemption III]** \nWhen you Cast a spell with an AOE, you can choose to ignore 5 targets.","x":1000,"y":9120,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-1","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency II]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 10 Mana.","x":500,"y":8820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-5","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Gate]** \nYou gain a bonus to DR against any spells or attacks targeting Willpower equal to the number of Major Wounds and Scars gained from [Equivalency].","x":500,"y":8940,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-11-3","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations IV]**\nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (4).","x":1460,"y":9500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-11-4","type":"text","text":"**[Invocations V]** \nYou can commune with Entities and are able to invoke them with spells of Complexity (5).","x":1940,"y":9500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-4","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency V]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 25 Mana.","x":1940,"y":8820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-6","type":"text","text":"**[Untested Formula]** \nAs an Interaction, you can spend 1 AP on your turn to make 5 Mana worth of adjustments to a spell you can Cast for the duration of the encounter.","x":1940,"y":8940,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-10-7","type":"text","text":"**[Spell Exemption I]** \nWhen you Cast a spell with an AOE, you can choose to ignore 1 target.","x":20,"y":9120,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-10","type":"text","text":"**[Throw Wide the Gate]** \nWhen Casting, you can re-open Scars to increase your Mana maximum by 5 per Scar re-opened until the end of the encounter. You must heal these Wounds as normal.","x":20,"y":9240,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-4","type":"text","text":"**[Wait for an Opening]** \nWhen you Wait, your next attack has Advantage (1).","x":20,"y":7960,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-9-6","type":"text","text":"**[Adrenaline Rush]** \nAs a free Interaction, you gain +2 AP during your turn. When you do, you suffer the Dazed (2) Condition. You cannot gain this AP while you are Dazed (#).","x":500,"y":8220,"width":410,"height":142},
		{"id":"n-9-8","type":"text","text":"**[Sticky Fingers]** \nYou can expend 1 AP to intercept a ranged Contraption that is targeting a space within Paces (5) of you. Make a Dexterity vs. Dexterity contest against the thrower; on a failure, their contraption is stolen and prevented from activating.","x":500,"y":8440,"width":410,"height":198},
		{"id":"n-9-5","type":"text","text":"**[Ambush]** \nIf you would begin an encounter having surprised the enemy, gain an additional +2 AP, exceeding your maximum AP.","x":20,"y":8080,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-10-0","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency I]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 5 Mana.","x":20,"y":8820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-2","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency III]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 15 Mana.","x":1000,"y":8820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-10-3","type":"text","text":"**[Equivalency IV]** \nGain a Major Wound of your choice. You can create and Cast spells up to 20 Mana.","x":1460,"y":8820,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-9-2","type":"text","text":"**[Steal - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 1 AP to rob a target, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, you steal one item that is not held or worn from their Encumbrance (ie, un-equipped Equipment).","x":20,"y":7680,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-3","type":"text","text":"**[Plant - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 1 AP to reverse pickpocket an item onto a target, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, you can force an Equipment or Contraption of Bulk (1) into their Encumbrance, which they cannot drop until the end of your next turn. If the item is a Contraption, you can choose to have it activate at the end of your turn.","x":500,"y":7680,"width":410,"height":264},
		{"id":"n-9-0","type":"text","text":"**[Pocket Sand - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 2 AP to throw sand into a target's eyes, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, they suffer Blinded (0) condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":7360,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-9-1","type":"text","text":"**[Skullduggery - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 2 AP to debilitate a target, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, roll a 1d10, with the result being a Surface or Aggravated Wound on the Major Wound table. The target gains the Additional Effects of the Wound until the end of the encounter, but not the Wound itself. A target can only be affected by this ability once per encounter.","x":1460,"y":7360,"width":410,"height":275},
		{"id":"n-9-7","type":"text","text":"**[Backstab]** \nWhen you attack a target while directly behind them, you deal 2x damage as if you had Critically hit.","x":1000,"y":8080,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-11","type":"text","text":"**[Guardian III]** \nYou can swear your loyalty to a Liege. When you are in combat with your Liege, you may choose to take your movement at the same time on either of your turns so long as you end within 5 Paces of each other. You cannot change your Liege unless you are dismissed from their charge, they die, or you die.","x":960,"y":6740,"width":410,"height":239},
		{"id":"n-7-12","type":"text","text":"**[Rivalry]** \nYou can declare a rival at the beginning of an encounter, granting you Advantage (1) on your first attack against them each turn, but Disadvantage (1) when attacking anyone else. When your rival has exited the encounter, the Disadvantage (1) ends.","x":480,"y":7013,"width":410,"height":213},
		{"id":"n-7-10","type":"text","text":"**[Guardian II]** \nIf another creature suffers damage within 5 Paces, you can expend 1 AP to move adjacent to them and then trigger [Guardian I].","x":480,"y":6740,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-8","type":"text","text":"**[Patience]** \nWhen you Wait, you immediately gain an additional +1 AP.","x":960,"y":6620,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-5","type":"text","text":"**[Critical Condition]** \nWhen you suffer a Major Wound, the next attack you make is a Critical hit.","x":20,"y":6316,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-7","type":"text","text":"**[Inquisition]** \nWhen you have a visible trophy from a dead Kin in your Encumbrance, you deal 2 additional damage against a target from the same Kin.","x":960,"y":6445,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-6","type":"text","text":"**[Flagellant]** \nWhenever you choose to deepen a wound from Minor to Moderate, or Moderate to Major, all targets within Earshot make their next attack against you with Disadvantage (1).","x":20,"y":6445,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-7-4","type":"text","text":"**[Resurgence]** \nWhen you suffer a Major Wound, you become immune to all Conditions until the end of your next turn, ending ones currently affecting you.","x":480,"y":6160,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-9","type":"text","text":"**[Guardian I]** \nWhen an adjacent creature takes damage, you can split the damage they would take after factoring in their DR. This damage ignores your DR.","x":20,"y":6744,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-8-6","type":"text","text":"**[Ballistician]** \nWeapons you are wielding gain the Thrown (10) property.","x":980,"y":5092,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-7-0","type":"text","text":"**[Vow of Poverty I]** \nYou gain +1 AP at the start of your turn whenever you don't have any Equipment in your Encumbrance.","x":500,"y":5736,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-1","type":"text","text":"**[Vow of Poverty II]** \nYou gain +2 AP at the start of your turn whenever you don't have any Equipment in your Encumbrance.","x":1460,"y":5736,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-7-2","type":"text","text":"**[Devoted]** \nOn taking this, choose a specific deity. You can cast only Invocations from your chosen deity, but gain twice as much Favor from their Acts of Favor. If you would ever surrender this, or gain Favor with another deity, you immediately surrender all Favor with the chosen deity and cannot regain it.","x":20,"y":5880,"width":410,"height":250},
		{"id":"n-7-3","type":"text","text":"**[Grit]** \nWhen you suffer a Major Wound, you make all d20 rolls with a +10 until the end of your next turn.","x":20,"y":6160,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-8-8","type":"text","text":"**[Strong Throw]** \nThe range of your Contraptions increases by Paces (5).","x":500,"y":5360,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-7","type":"text","text":"**[Re-Equip]** \nYou do not need to expend AP to draw or stow items.","x":20,"y":5240,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-9","type":"text","text":"**[Safeguard]** \nEquipment you are wearing or wielding cannot suffer Damaged (#).","x":500,"y":5500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-2","type":"text","text":"**[Grenadier III]**\nYour Spheres (#) are 1 larger, for a total of 3.","x":1940,"y":4640,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-1","type":"text","text":"**[Grenadier II]** \nYour Spheres (#) are 1 larger, for a total of 2.","x":980,"y":4640,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-3","type":"text","text":"**[Toolbelt]** \nThe first Interaction on your turn with a Contraption costs 1 AP less.","x":500,"y":4760,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-8-5","type":"text","text":"**[Ricochet]** \nWhen you make an attack with a Thrown weapon, make an attack with the same roll against another target within range.","x":20,"y":5076,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-8-4","type":"text","text":"**[Trauma Care]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to use Medicine (#) to remove three times as much Bleeding (#).","x":20,"y":4917,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-8-0","type":"text","text":"**[Grenadier I]** \nYour Spheres (#) are 1 larger.","x":20,"y":4640,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-6-1","type":"text","text":"**[Steady Feet II]** \nEffects that would force you to move against your will move you 2 less Paces, for a total of 3 Paces.","x":500,"y":3940,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-6-2","type":"text","text":"**[Steady Feet III]** \nEffects that would force you to move against your will move you 3 less Paces, for a total of 6 Paces.","x":980,"y":3940,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-6-3","type":"text","text":"**[Steady Feet IV]** \nYou are immune to effects that would force you to move against your will.","x":1460,"y":3940,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-4","type":"text","text":"**[Slip Past]** \nYou can freely move through any creature’s space.","x":500,"y":4080,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-6","type":"text","text":"**[Nimble Body]** \nWhen choosing to Evade, you may use your Dexterity for the Contest in place of Strength.","x":500,"y":4260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-5","type":"text","text":"**[Waylay]** \nWhenever you move through another creature's space for the first time on your turn, you can make an attack against them without expending AP.","x":1940,"y":4080,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-5-6","type":"text","text":"**[Implacable]** \nIf you have AP, you can Counter rolls even from sides you aren't facing.","x":500,"y":3040,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-0","type":"text","text":"**[Steady Feet]** \nEffects that would force you to move against your will move you 1 less Pace.","x":20,"y":3940,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-6-7","type":"text","text":"**[Break Out]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to end the Tethered Condition on yourself.","x":20,"y":4380,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-11","type":"text","text":"**[Offensive Stance]** \nAs part of a Pivot, you can assume or drop an offensive stance. You cannot Block or Counter; when you deal damage using your Strength or Dexterity, you can add the other stat to the damage as well.","x":500,"y":3377,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-5-12","type":"text","text":"**[Defensive Stance]** \nAs part of a Pivot, you can assume or drop a defensive stance. You no longer add your Strength or Dexterity to damage you deal; when you Block or Counter, you add your Strength or Dexterity to the damage you reduce or deal.","x":500,"y":3597,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-5-4","type":"text","text":"**[En Garde]** \nYou can always Counter even if you have 0 AP; instead, gain 1 less AP at the start of your turn for each time you Countered this way. If you would gain 0 AP, suffer 1 Fatigue.","x":500,"y":2860,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-5-7","type":"text","text":"**[Distant Counter]** \nYou can Counter against an attack made outside your Reach, using the countered weapon's damage die.","x":980,"y":3040,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-9","type":"text","text":"**[Arterial Spray]** \nWhen you would inflict the Bleeding (#) Condition to a target, you can instead convert it into the Dazed (#) or Unsteady (#) Conditions.","x":1460,"y":3220,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-3","type":"text","text":"**[Counterplay]** \nIf you win a Counter, you can perform a Maneuver in place of the attack.","x":20,"y":2860,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-8","type":"text","text":"**[Serrated Strike - Maneuver]** \nYou swing to leave a grisly cut, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, the target suffers the Bleeding (1) Condition.","x":20,"y":3220,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-10","type":"text","text":"**[Heel Turn]** \nYou can Pivot at any point during a round, including before an attack is resolved.","x":20,"y":3377,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-5-0","type":"text","text":"**[Strong Riposte]** \nWhen you Critically succeed the first roll of a Counter, you automatically win the second Contest.","x":20,"y":2540,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-5","type":"text","text":"**[Warrior in a Garden]** \nIf you did not spend any AP on your turn to deal damage or perform Maneuvers, you make the second roll of all Counters with Advantage (1) until your next turn.","x":980,"y":2860,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-4-0","type":"text","text":"**[Fellowship]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to Help an ally at a range up to Paces (5) during combat.","x":40,"y":1600,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-4-5","type":"text","text":"**[Rile]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to motivate a target within Earshot, granting them Advantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":520,"y":1891,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-6","type":"text","text":"**[Rally]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to grant all allies within Earshot Advantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":980,"y":1891,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-7","type":"text","text":"**[Castigate]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to demoralize a target within Earshot, making a Willpower vs. Willpower Contest; on a failure, they suffer Disadvantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":520,"y":2040,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-4-8","type":"text","text":"**[Daunt]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to dismay all targets within Earshot, making a Willpower vs. Willpower Contest; on a failure, each target suffers Disadvantage (1) on their next attack or defense.","x":980,"y":2040,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-4-9","type":"text","text":"**[Stall]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 2 AP to make a Willpower vs. Willpower contest against a target within earshot; on a failure, their turn is moved to the end of the initiative order.","x":980,"y":2260,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-5-1","type":"text","text":"**[Quick Riposte]** \nWhen choosing to Counter, you may choose to use your Dexterity on the second roll in place of Strength.","x":500,"y":2540,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-5-2","type":"text","text":"**[Deep Cut]** \nIf the damage your Counter deals would inflict a Wound, the target also suffers the Bleeding (1) Condition.","x":500,"y":2700,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-4-2","type":"text","text":"**[Changeling's Luck I]** \nAfter Critically rolling an attack, you are immune to Critical hits until the end of your next turn.","x":40,"y":1746,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-4-4","type":"text","text":"**[Monologue]** \nYour word limit is doubled in combat.","x":40,"y":1891,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-4-3","type":"text","text":"**[Changeling's Luck II]** \nAfter Critically succeeding a roll, you are immune to Critical hits until the end of the next round.","x":520,"y":1746,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-4-1","type":"text","text":"**[Inspiring]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to grant 1 AP to a target within Earshot.","x":980,"y":1600,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-15-2","type":"text","text":"**[Lethality]** \nWhen attacking with a Mass weapon, but before you roll, you may choose to expend 1 additional AP to increase the weapon's damage die by 1 stage.","x":20,"y":12200,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-15-3","type":"text","text":"**[All-or-Nothing]** \nWhen attacking with a Mass weapon, but before you roll, you may choose to expend 2 additional AP to double the damage die.","x":1000,"y":12200,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-15-0","type":"text","text":"**[Denting Blow]** \nWhen you roll a Critical hit against a target while attacking with a Mass weapon, you can forgo all damage to instead inflict Damaged (1) on all of the target's armor.","x":20,"y":11860,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-15-1","type":"text","text":"**[Stunning Blow]** \nWhen you roll a Critical hit against a target while attacking with a Mass weapon, they gain Dazed (#), with (#) being the overkill damage.","x":20,"y":12040,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-1-2","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Will]** \nWhile wearing full armor (upper, middle, lower), you use your lowest DR against untyped damage.","x":500,"y":-800,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-2-3","type":"text","text":"**[Reckless Strike]** \nAs a Free Interaction, you can choose to roll damage you deal during your turn with Advantage (1); all damage dealt to you until your next turn is rolled with Advantage (1).","x":20,"y":80,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-2-0","type":"text","text":"**[Trample]** \nDamage dealt by your forced movement ending early is increased by one die size.","x":20,"y":-100,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-2-8","type":"text","text":"**[Rend Weapon - Maneuver]** \nYou shatter the target’s weapon, making a standard attack. If you hit the target, their weapon suffers the Damaged (1) Condition.","x":20,"y":540,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-2-6","type":"text","text":"**[Blockade]** \nIf a creature would move through a space adjacent to you on their turn, you can expend 1 AP to initiate a Strength vs. Strength Contest; on a failure, the target's movement immediately ends.","x":20,"y":280,"width":410,"height":160},
		{"id":"n-1-3","type":"text","text":"**[Steel Will]** \nWhile wearing full armor (upper, middle, lower), you use your highest DR against untyped damage.","x":980,"y":-800,"width":410,"height":122},
		{"id":"n-1-10","type":"text","text":"**[Gutsy]** \nYour Heavy weapons gain the Defensive property against attacks made outside your Reach, without reducing the damage die.","x":500,"y":-400,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-1-11","type":"text","text":"**[Iron Slab]** \nYour Heavy weapons gain the Defensive property against all attacks, without reducing the damage die.","x":980,"y":-400,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-1-9","type":"text","text":"**[Bloodgilt]** \nIf you are not wearing armor, you gain DR equal to the number of Wounds in your Encumbrance.","x":980,"y":-520,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-4","type":"text","text":"**[Endurance I]** \nYour HP total is increased by 2.","x":500,"y":-640,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-2-4","type":"text","text":"**[In Extremis]** \nWhen you roll Strength to attack, you deal additional damage equal to the amount of Wounds in your Encumbrance.","x":1440,"y":110,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-2-1","type":"text","text":"**[Shove]** \nYou can move through another creature’s space, initiating a Strength vs. Strength contest; on a failure, you move the target 1 Pace horizontally in a direction of your choice.","x":480,"y":-100,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-2-2","type":"text","text":"**[Rush]** \nWhen you forcibly move a target, you can make an attack against them without expending AP. This attack ends your movement.","x":1440,"y":-100,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-2-9","type":"text","text":"**[Rend Armor - Maneuver]** \nYou shatter the target’s armor, making a standard attack. If you hit the target, their armor suffers the Damaged (1) Condition.","x":480,"y":540,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-3-0","type":"text","text":"**[Inertia]** \nYou can take Movement equal to your Speed after reducing a target to 0 HP, without expending AP.","x":20,"y":960,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-3-1","type":"text","text":"**[Marathon]** \nIf all your available AP in a turn is spent on Movement, double the number of Paces you would move.","x":500,"y":960,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-2-5","type":"text","text":"**[Adjust Grip]** \nYou can wield Heavy weapons in one hand.","x":1440,"y":280,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-2-7","type":"text","text":"**[Bulwark]** \nSpaces within your Reach cost 1 additional Pace of movement for enemies moving through them.","x":480,"y":315,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-2-10","type":"text","text":"**[Disable - Maneuver]** \nYou compromise the target’s stance, making a Strength vs. Strength Contest against an adjacent target; on a failure, they cannot use Maneuvers this round.","x":20,"y":700,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-3-2","type":"text","text":"**[Fleetfoot]** \nYou move an additional Pace when you Evade.","x":20,"y":1140,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-3-4","type":"text","text":"**[Alacrity]** \nYou gain AP at the start of the round, rather than the start of your turn.","x":20,"y":1260,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-5","type":"text","text":"**[Haste I]** \nYour base Speed is increased by 1.","x":500,"y":1380,"width":410,"height":59},
		{"id":"n-3-3","type":"text","text":"**[Uncanny Swiftness]** \nThe first time in a round you Block, Evade, or Counter, you expend 0 AP.","x":980,"y":1140,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-8","type":"text","text":"**[Haste IV]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 4.","x":1940,"y":1380,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-6","type":"text","text":"**[Haste II]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 2.","x":980,"y":1380,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-3-7","type":"text","text":"**[Haste III]** \nYour base Speed is further increased by 1, for a total of 3.","x":1460,"y":1380,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-8","type":"text","text":"**[Thick Skin]** \nIf you are not wearing armor, you gain DR equal to the number of scars in your Encumbrance.","x":20,"y":-520,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-5","type":"text","text":"**[Endurance II]** \nYour HP total is further increased by 2, for a total of 4.","x":1440,"y":-640,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-16-2","type":"text","text":"**[Mirror Shield]** \nWhile wielding a Shield, if you Block all damage dealt to you, you can choose to have any excess amount dealt back to your attacker.","x":500,"y":12620,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-16-0","type":"text","text":"**[Shieldbash]** \nWhen attacking with a Shield, you can perform the Push and Trip Maneuvers with it.","x":20,"y":12500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-16-1","type":"text","text":"**[Aegis]** \nShields you wield do not have a reduced damage die from the Defensive property.","x":1000,"y":12500,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-16-3","type":"text","text":"**[Blast Shield]** \nWhile wielding a Shield, you halve the damage dealt by effects with the Sphere or Cone property.","x":1000,"y":12620,"width":410,"height":114},
		{"id":"n-23-0","type":"text","text":"**[Drakesblood]** \nPre-requisite: Aarayni. \nReduce Freezing (#) and Burning (#) by one additional at the end of your turn.","x":20,"y":16340,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-23-1","type":"text","text":"**[Hymnary]** \nPre-requisite: Lagainian. \nTheurgy Spells you cast are always considered Complexity (1).","x":20,"y":16520,"width":410,"height":140},
		{"id":"n-23-2","type":"text","text":"**[Chevalier]** \nPre-requisite: Tousavi. \nYour human hirelings can use your Willpower modifier in place of their own when making Morale Saves.","x":20,"y":16700,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-23-3","type":"text","text":"**[Binder]** \nPre-requisite: Marat'an. \nWhen you successfully identify a spell or artifact you gain 1 Favor with an Entity of your choice.","x":20,"y":16880,"width":410,"height":142},
		{"id":"n-22-2","type":"text","text":"**[Point-Blank Shot]** \nWhen attacking with a Crossbow, you can ignore the minimum range of your weapon.","x":500,"y":16100,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-19-2","type":"text","text":"**[Exenterate]** \nIf you expend 3+ AP on performing attacks with a Dagger weapon, you can make another attack with a Dagger weapon without expending AP.","x":1940,"y":14116,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-19-0","type":"text","text":"**[Quickdraw]** \nWhen you draw your Dagger at the start of combat, you can immediately make an attack with it before anyone has taken their turn without expending AP.","x":20,"y":14100,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-19-3","type":"text","text":"**[Ransom]** \nWhen attacking an adjacent target with a Dagger, you can perform the Grapple Maneuver; grapples performed this way deal the Dagger's damage against a target attempting to break free and inflict the Bleeding (1) Condition.","x":500,"y":14272,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-19-1","type":"text","text":"**[Double Stab]** \nWhen attacking with a Dagger, you can choose to make the attack at Disadvantage (1). You can then make an additional attack at Disadvantage (1) without expending AP.","x":1000,"y":14100,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-19-4","type":"text","text":"**[Bleedout]** \nWhen you inflict the Bleeding (#) Condition, it is always 1 higher.","x":1460,"y":14275,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-19-5","type":"text","text":"**[Hamstring - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 2 AP to embed your Dagger at a lethal junction, making a Dexterity vs. Strength Contest; on a failure, your Dagger is lodged in the target until they spend 3 AP to remove it. While the Dagger is embedded, whenever the target would move more than half its Speed in a turn, they gain a Minor Wound.","x":1000,"y":14480,"width":410,"height":239},
		{"id":"n-21-0","type":"text","text":"**[Longshot I]** \nWhen attacking with a Bow, you can choose to attack at up to twice the listed range at Disadvantage (1).","x":500,"y":15360,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-21-2","type":"text","text":"**[Pin - Maneuver]** \nYou can expend 2 AP to pin a target, making a Dexterity vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, the target suffers the Prone Condition with Persist (1).","x":500,"y":15520,"width":410,"height":142},
		{"id":"n-21-3","type":"text","text":"**[Aimed Shot]** \nWhen attacking with a Bow weapon, you can perform the Disarm Maneuver with it.","x":500,"y":15700,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"03ea185ddfe36015","type":"text","text":"**[Longshot II]** \nWhen attacking with a Bow, you can choose to attack at up to thrice the listed range at Disadvantage (1).","x":1460,"y":15360,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-21-4","type":"text","text":"**[Volley]** \nIf you expend 3+ AP on performing attacks with a Bow weapon, you can make another attack with a Bow weapon without expending AP.","x":1460,"y":15700,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-20-0","type":"text","text":"**[Unstoppable Blows]** \nWhen attacking with a Flail, you ignore the Defensive property of the target's Equipment.","x":20,"y":14860,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-20-2","type":"text","text":"**[Tie-Up]** \nWhen attacking with a Flail, you can perform the Grapple Maneuver; targets grappled this way suffer the Tethered (#) Condition, with (#) being your distance when you performed the maneuver.","x":500,"y":15040,"width":410,"height":171},
		{"id":"n-20-1","type":"text","text":"**[Swing Around - Maneuver]** \nYou swing your Flail in the target's blindspot, making a Strength vs. Dexterity Contest; on a failure, you can make an attack as if you were directly behind the target.","x":1000,"y":14860,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-22-0","type":"text","text":"**[Hotswap]** \nAfter successfully snaring a target with a Bola, you can immediately swap to a Crossbow and make an attack without expending AP.","x":20,"y":15940,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-22-1","type":"text","text":"**[Piercing Shot]** \nWhen attacking with a Crossbow, Defenders cannot benefit from Partially Covered, so long as the terrain is Hardness (1) or less.","x":20,"y":16100,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-18-0","type":"text","text":"**[Walking Stick]** \nWhen wielding a Hook, you are immune to the Unsteady Condition.","x":20,"y":13710,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-18-1","type":"text","text":"**[Shepherd]** \nWhen attacking with a Hook weapon, you can perform the Push and Pull Maneuvers with it.","x":20,"y":13830,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-18-2","type":"text","text":"**[Disarming Sweep]** \nWhen attacking with a Hook, you can perform the Disarm Maneuver.","x":1000,"y":13830,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-17-0","type":"text","text":"**[Scour]** \nWhen attacking with an Axe and reducing a target to 0 HP, you may make another attack against a different target within range without expending AP.","x":20,"y":12900,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-17-2","type":"text","text":"**[Running Start II]** \nWhen throwing an Axe weapon you can move 1 additional Pace in any direction as part of the attack, for a total of 2 Paces.","x":500,"y":13094,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-17-3","type":"text","text":"**[Pry Aside - Maneuver]** \nYou pull aside the target's shield with your Axe, making a Strength vs. Strength Contest; on a failure, the target does not benefit from the Defensive property of their weapon until their next turn.","x":500,"y":13240,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-17-5","type":"text","text":"**[Executioner's Strike]** \nWhen attacking with an Axe weapon, but before you roll, you may choose to expend 1 AP to increase the weapon's Crit range by 1 (20 -> 19).","x":500,"y":13456,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-17-1","type":"text","text":"**[Running Start I]** \nWhen throwing an Axe weapon you can move 1 Pace in any direction as part of the attack.","x":20,"y":13094,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-17-4","type":"text","text":"**[Felling Chop]** \nWhen attacking with an Axe weapon, you can perform the Trip Maneuver with it.","x":20,"y":13456,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-0","type":"text","text":"**[Impenetrable]**\nWhile wearing full armor (upper, middle, lower), you gain 1 DR against all damage types.","x":20,"y":-940,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-1-1","type":"text","text":"**[Well-Fitted]** \nOne piece of armor you are wearing takes up one less Encumbrance, to a minimum of Bulk (1).","x":500,"y":-940,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-6","type":"text","text":"**[Imitation]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 3 AP to learn any 1 EXP Ability from a target within Eyesight. You can use this ability until the end of the encounter.","x":1940,"y":-1280,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-0-4","type":"text","text":"**[Momentum]** \nWhenever you Push a roll, you also grant yourself Advantage (1).","x":500,"y":-1420,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-5","type":"text","text":"**[Tireless]** \nThe first time in a day you would gain Fatigue during combat, you ignore it.","x":980,"y":-1420,"width":410,"height":91},
		{"id":"n-0-1","type":"text","text":"**[Brace]**\nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to brace yourself for a powerful blow. You gain a +1 modifier to all your defensive contests until your next turn.","x":20,"y":-1600,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"n-0-2","type":"text","text":"**[Shout]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to steel the resolve of a target within Earshot. They gain a +1 modifier to all their defensive contests until their next turn.","x":500,"y":-1600,"width":410,"height":155},
		{"id":"090c0e78c2b0fda0","type":"text","text":"**[Focus]** \nAs an Interaction, you can expend 1 AP to increase the damage modifier of attacks which use your Strength or Dexterity by +1 for the remainder of the encounter, or until you take damage.","x":20,"y":-1820,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"497d0936a1587d36","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n**EXP Cost: 2**\n\n</div>","x":500,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"a6ae4ce4a873c99d","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n**EXP Cost: 3**\n\n</div>","x":980,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"e592d3a3f61f8072","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n**EXP Cost: 1**\n\n</div>","x":20,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"2ddb96cdf012a57a","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n**EXP Cost: 4**\n\n</div>","x":1460,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"0430e2d1c04c040e","type":"text","text":"<div class=\"centered\">\n\n**EXP Cost: 5**\n\n</div>","x":1940,"y":-2040,"width":410,"height":100},
		{"id":"n-24-0","type":"text","text":"**[Swift as Wind - Maneuver]** \nPre-requisite: Revolutionary Army. \nWhen attacking with one Dual Wielded weapon, you can expend 1 additional AP to make a second attack with the other. You roll for both of these attacks at the same time; the target can only Counter, Block, or Evade one of them.","x":500,"y":17140,"width":410,"height":213},
		{"id":"n-24-1","type":"text","text":"**[Strong as Tide - Maneuver]** \nPre-requisite: Revolutionary Army. \nWhen attacking with a Two-Handed weapon, you can expend 1 additional AP to batter down their defenses. The next attack made against them has Advantage (2).","x":500,"y":17380,"width":410,"height":188},
		{"id":"n-24-2","type":"text","text":"**[Malefica]** \nPre-requisite: Revolutionary Army. \nWhen you Cast, you can expend 1 additional AP to roll the Willpower contest with Advantage (1).","x":980,"y":17600,"width":410,"height":123},
		{"id":"n-24-3","type":"text","text":"**[Empty Heaven]** \nPre-requisite: Furnace of Man. \nReduce the AP cost of all spells by 1.","x":980,"y":17760,"width":410,"height":91}
	],
